      "originalText": "SeriesKey Skeleton\n// 写入或查找时先构造 skeleton key，不拥有 encoded tag set，只引用外部字符串\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+----------------------+\n| data_point_    | series_id_ | hash_code_     | tag_set_size_  | external tag set ref |\n+----------------+------------+----------------+----------------+----------------------+\n| nullptr        | INVALID    | 8 B            | 4 B            | no inline ownership  |",
