      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "+===============================================+\n| SSTable file                                  |\n+===============================================+\n| Metric Block #0                               |\n|   - column layout or PAX layout               |\n|   - metric footer                             |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| Metric Block #1                               |\n|   - column layout or PAX layout               |\n|   - metric footer                             |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| ...                                           |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| optional EC padding after metrics             |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| Metric Index                                  |\n|   metric name -> metric block offset / size   |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| optional EC padding before SSTable footer     |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| SSTable Footer                                |\n|   protobuf SSTableFooter                      |\n|   crc + size + version + magic                |\n+===============================================+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+===============================================+\n| SSTable file                                  |\n+===============================================+\n| Metric Block #0                               |\n|   - column layout or PAX layout               |\n|   - metric footer                             |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| Metric Block #1                               |\n|   - column layout or PAX layout               |\n|   - metric footer                             |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| ...                                           |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| optional EC padding after metrics             |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| Metric Index                                  |\n|   metric name -> metric block offset / size   |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| optional EC padding before SSTable footer     |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n| SSTable Footer                                |\n|   protobuf SSTableFooter                      |\n|   crc + size + version + magic                |\n+===============================================+",
