      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MemTable query access flow\n\nfilter\n  |\n  v\nMetricObject::GetSeriesInfo\n  |\n  +--> FilterByIndex\n  |       |\n  |       +-- use index_\n  |       |\n  |       v\n  |   series_id list\n  |\n  +--> FilterByScan\n          |\n          +-- scan series_map_\n          |\n          v\n      series_id list\n          |\n          | for each series_id\n          v\n      series_keys_[series_id]\n          |\n          v\n      SeriesKey\n          |\n          +-- hash_code_ -> ScanSeries.hash_code\n          |\n          +-- tag_set_str_\n          |       |\n          |       v\n          |   decode tags -> ScanSeries.tags\n          |\n          +-- data_point_\n                  |\n                  v\n              DataPointSet::GetDPS\n                  |\n                  v\n              ScanSeries.timestamps\n              ScanSeries.fields",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MemTable query access flow\n\nfilter\n  |\n  v\nMetricObject::GetSeriesInfo\n  |\n  +--> FilterByIndex\n  |       |\n  |       +-- use index_\n  |       |\n  |       v\n  |   series_id list\n  |\n  +--> FilterByScan\n          |\n          +-- scan series_map_\n          |\n          v\n      series_id list\n          |\n          | for each series_id\n          v\n      series_keys_[series_id]\n          |\n          v\n      SeriesKey\n          |\n          +-- hash_code_ -> ScanSeries.hash_code\n          |\n          +-- tag_set_str_\n          |       |\n          |       v\n          |   decode tags -> ScanSeries.tags\n          |\n          +-- data_point_\n                  |\n                  v\n              DataPointSet::GetDPS\n                  |\n                  v\n              ScanSeries.timestamps\n              ScanSeries.fields",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
