        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786607418837,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Index\nMemTable 的主数据不依赖索引存在，索引对象按需异步创建\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n| inverted_index_              | hash_index_                  |\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n| tag_key_id -> InvertedIndex* | tag_key_id -> HashIndex*     |\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n| default for most tag keys    | selected high-frequency keys |\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Index\nMemTable 的主数据不依赖索引存在，索引对象按需异步创建\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n| inverted_index_              | hash_index_                  |\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n| tag_key_id -> InvertedIndex* | tag_key_id -> HashIndex*     |\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+\n| default for most tag keys    | selected high-frequency keys |\n+------------------------------+------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-IQIXD-7EwQMHnL8zc2SF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3326.4222092401424,
      "y": 1385.450102306547,
      "width": 615.9991455078125,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1854322537,
      "version": 259,
      "versionNonce": 1903875879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786607376132,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EncodedSeries.tags\n  |\n  | for each EncodedTag(tag_key_id, tag_val_id)\n  v\nIndex::Insert\n  |\n  +-- tag_key_id in hash_tag_keys_ ? -- yes ---> HashIndex::Insert\n  |\n  +------------------------------------ no ----> InvertedIndex::Insert",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EncodedSeries.tags\n  |\n  | for each EncodedTag(tag_key_id, tag_val_id)\n  v\nIndex::Insert\n  |\n  +-- tag_key_id in hash_tag_keys_ ? -- yes ---> HashIndex::Insert\n  |\n  +------------------------------------ no ----> InvertedIndex::Insert",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Q0xa5v89KVrveW-0H-EWh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2364.357583182199,
      "y": 1604.1284877232142,
      "width": 554.3992309570312,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 390509735,
      "version": 141,
      "versionNonce": 1124889927,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "NpOVB1Xr9usXya1fmgPx_",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786607555778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "InvertedIndex\nentry 内部保存一个 roaring bitmap\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| index_status_ : INIT / PROCESSING / DONE                    |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| tagv_to_entry_map_                                          |\n|   tag_value_id -> entry_id                                  |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| index_entries_ : IterateSafeVector<InvertedIndexEntry>      |\n|   entry_id -> { tag_value_, roaring::Roaring* }             |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| inverted_index_lock_ protects map, entries, statistics      |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "InvertedIndex\nentry 内部保存一个 roaring bitmap\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| index_status_ : INIT / PROCESSING / DONE                    |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| tagv_to_entry_map_                                          |\n|   tag_value_id -> entry_id                                  |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| index_entries_ : IterateSafeVector<InvertedIndexEntry>      |\n|   entry_id -> { tag_value_, roaring::Roaring* }             |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| inverted_index_lock_ protects map, entries, statistics      |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Rq_NDw5hBoy6qGNJplpjc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2966.187010265533,
      "y": 1601.8042689732133,
      "width": 768.7993774414062,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 483385833,
      "version": 183,
      "versionNonce": 605076393,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "EtwgYONX1FNB7z8CzQX62",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786610233247,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HashIndex\n默认包含 `host`、`pod_name`、`instance`\n按 `tag_value_id` 低位分片保存 `(tag_value_id, series_id)` pair\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| index_status_ : INIT / PROCESSING / DONE                    |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| shard_array_[1024] : vector<ValueIdPair>                    |\n|   shard = tag_value_id & 1023                               |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| series_cnt_  : distinct inserted series count               |\n| total_items_ : insert attempts                              |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| hash_index_lock_ protects shard_array_ and statistics       |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n1. 插入时先计算 shard，再在该 shard 的 vector 中按 `series_id` 做 `lower_bound`，避免同一个\nseries 在这个 tag key 的 HashIndex 内重复插入\n2. 查询某个 value 时，只能先通过 `tag_value_id & SHARD_MASK` 找到候选 shard，再扫描该 shard\n内所有 pair，筛出 `pair.value == tag_value_id` 的 series id，最后构造临时 roaring bitmap",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HashIndex\n默认包含 `host`、`pod_name`、`instance`\n按 `tag_value_id` 低位分片保存 `(tag_value_id, series_id)` pair\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| index_status_ : INIT / PROCESSING / DONE                    |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| shard_array_[1024] : vector<ValueIdPair>                    |\n|   shard = tag_value_id & 1023                               |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| series_cnt_  : distinct inserted series count               |\n| total_items_ : insert attempts                              |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n| hash_index_lock_ protects shard_array_ and statistics       |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------+\n1. 插入时先计算 shard，再在该 shard 的 vector 中按 `series_id` 做 `lower_bound`，避免同一个\nseries 在这个 tag key 的 HashIndex 内重复插入\n2. 查询某个 value 时，只能先通过 `tag_value_id & SHARD_MASK` 找到候选 shard，再扫描该 shard\n内所有 pair，筛出 `pair.value == tag_value_id` 的 series id，最后构造临时 roaring bitmap",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OHAQ9HC-TxTb1pIt5prjf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1971.4379970005589,
      "y": 1155.293852306547,
      "width": 475.1993408203125,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
