      "seed": 1753448871,
      "version": 683,
      "versionNonce": 829603423,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787193803788,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "文件级定位关系：\nSSTableFooter\n  |\n  +-- metric_index: absolute offset + size\n  |\n  +-- metric_index_root_page: relative offset inside metric index + size\n  |\n  +-- time range / lsn range / metric count / series count\n\nMetricIndex\n  |\n  +-- metric_name -> metric_block_absolute_offset + metric_block_size\n\nMetricBlock\n  |\n  +-- metric data pages\n  +-- metric footer\n\n最重要的不变量：\nMetric block offset 是文件绝对 offset。\nColumnMeta 内的 page offset 是相对当前 metric block 起点的 offset。\n读取列页时需要:\n  absolute_page_offset = metric_offset + column_meta.page_location.offset",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "文件级定位关系：\nSSTableFooter\n  |\n  +-- metric_index: absolute offset + size\n  |\n  +-- metric_index_root_page: relative offset inside metric index + size\n  |\n  +-- time range / lsn range / metric count / series count\n\nMetricIndex\n  |\n  +-- metric_name -> metric_block_absolute_offset + metric_block_size\n\nMetricBlock\n  |\n  +-- metric data pages\n  +-- metric footer\n\n最重要的不变量：\nMetric block offset 是文件绝对 offset。\nColumnMeta 内的 page offset 是相对当前 metric block 起点的 offset。\n读取列页时需要:\n  absolute_page_offset = metric_offset + column_meta.page_location.offset",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
