          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787282327297,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SSTableFooter\n// 本身是 protobuf payload，不是 C struct；\n// 字段没有固定 byte offset。`uint64` / `uint32` 使用 protobuf varint 编码\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| begin_timestamp        | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| end_timestamp          | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| start_lsn              | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| end_lsn                | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| num_metrics            | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| num_rows               | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| metric_index           | PageLocation            |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| metric_index_root_page | PageLocation            |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| intervals              | repeated uint64 varint  |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| aggregators            | repeated uint32 varint  |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| time_precision         | string                  |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SSTableFooter\n// 本身是 protobuf payload，不是 C struct；\n// 字段没有固定 byte offset。`uint64` / `uint32` 使用 protobuf varint 编码\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| begin_timestamp        | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| end_timestamp          | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| start_lsn              | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| end_lsn                | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| num_metrics            | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| num_rows               | uint64 varint           |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| metric_index           | PageLocation            |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| metric_index_root_page | PageLocation            |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| intervals              | repeated uint64 varint  |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| aggregators            | repeated uint32 varint  |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+\n| time_precision         | string                  |\n+------------------------+-------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
