      "text": "internal page\n+----------------+----------------+------------------------------+\n| page entry 0   | child max key  | child page offset / size     |\n| page entry 1   | child max key  | child page offset / size     |\n| ...            | ...            | ...                          |\n+----------------+----------------+------------------------------+",
