      "text": "Common Page Structure\n+----------------+----------------+----------------------+------------------+\n| checksum       | header_length  | PageHeader protobuf  | compressed body  |\n+----------------+----------------+----------------------+------------------+\n| 4 B            | 4 B            | header_length bytes  | compressed_size  |\n+----------------+----------------+----------------------+------------------+",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
